[
  {
    "text": "每次出差旅行",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 1.185,
    "duration": 1.185
  },
  {
    "text": "是不是都在为带哪个吹风机发愁",
    "start_time": 1.185,
    "end_time": 3.951,
    "duration": 2.766
  },
  {
    "text": "酒店的吹风机",
    "start_time": 3.951,
    "end_time": 5.136,
    "duration": 1.185
  },
  {
    "text": "风小还伤发",
    "start_time": 5.136,
    "end_time": 6.124,
    "duration": 0.988
  },
  {
    "text": "我真的会谢",
    "start_time": 6.124,
    "end_time": 7.111,
    "duration": 0.988
  },
  {
    "text": "还好被我挖到了这个出差神器",
    "start_time": 7.111,
    "end_time": 9.679,
    "duration": 2.568
  },
  {
    "text": "它折起来就比手机大一点点",
    "start_time": 9.679,
    "end_time": 12.05,
    "duration": 2.37
  },
  {
    "text": "放包里",
    "start_time": 12.05,
    "end_time": 12.642,
    "duration": 0.593
  },
  {
    "text": "行李箱里巨省地方",
    "start_time": 12.642,
    "end_time": 14.223,
    "duration": 1.58
  },
  {
    "text": "别看它小",
    "start_time": 14.223,
    "end_time": 15.013,
    "duration": 0.79
  },
  {
    "text": "11万转的风力可不是盖的",
    "start_time": 15.013,
    "end_time": 17.383,
    "duration": 2.37
  },
  {
    "text": "我这长头发",
    "start_time": 17.383,
    "end_time": 18.371,
    "duration": 0.988
  },
  {
    "text": "几分钟就搞定了",
    "start_time": 18.371,
    "end_time": 19.754,
    "duration": 1.383
  },
  {
    "text": "而且它这个屏显调温我真的超爱",
    "start_time": 19.754,
    "end_time": 22.519,
    "duration": 2.766
  },
  {
    "text": "想要什么温度自己调",
    "start_time": 22.519,
    "end_time": 24.297,
    "duration": 1.778
  },
  {
    "text": "清清楚楚",
    "start_time": 24.297,
    "end_time": 25.087,
    "duration": 0.79
  },
  {
    "text": "经常出门的姐妹",
    "start_time": 25.087,
    "end_time": 26.47,
    "duration": 1.383
  },
  {
    "text": "这个颜值高又强悍的小东西",
    "start_time": 26.47,
    "end_time": 28.841,
    "duration": 2.37
  },
  {
    "text": "必须焊在你的行李箱里",
    "start_time": 28.841,
    "end_time": 30.816,
    "duration": 1.975
  }
]